      "content": "it's just... even that feels like too much effort. i feel like i'm on a treadmill that's going too fast and i'm too tired to even try to step off. even if i quit, the shame and the noise of my life would just follow me. it feels like there is no way to actually get the silence i need. everything is just so loud and constant.",
